<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 06.</p>
<p>				    May 06/May 05   May 06/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.05		 5.64</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 4.25</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.21		 7.97</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.36		44.87</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -2.22		27.77</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -2.36		28.63</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.12		 6.78</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.89		15.57</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -2.17		33.21</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -2.36		32.62</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.35		12.38</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    1.28		63.64</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,065,943,921,375</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,856,849,999,436</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  2,919,997,333,480</p>
<p>  International funds			    88,342,774,842</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    200,753,813,618</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
